  "prefLabel": "Plc 102.30 Policy-autonomous board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 102.30 “Policy-autonomous board” means a board for a profession for which the practice act confers the authority to establish substantive requirements, such as requirements for licensure, directly on the board.\n\nSource. #14135, eff 12-1-24 (formerly Plc 202.30",
